OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after fatal
OL,4,Atwo-vehicle crash on A52
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged following a
OL,7,Ffatal crash on the A52 in
OL,8,FLeicestershire.
OL,10,FPolice said on 28 June 2024, a crash
OL,11,Finvolving a blue Citroen C4 Picasso and
OL,12,Fa purple Citroen C3 Picasso occurred
OL,13,Fclose to the junction with Grantham
OL,14,FRoad in Bottesford.
OL,16,FThe driver of the purple car,
OL,17,F53-year-old Clinton Baker from Bestwood
OL,18,Fin Nottingham, sustained fatal injuries
OL,19,Fand was pronounced dead at the scene,
OL,20,Fthe force added.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
